<title>FRANCE: Broker upgrades Danone.</title>
<headline>Broker upgrades Danone.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale's brokerage has upgraded French food group Danone to &quot;outperform&quot; from &quot;neutral&quot;, market sources said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The brokerage has, however, maintained its profits forecast at an increase of six percent. The upgrade stemmed from the rise in Danone's share price, the said.</p>
<p>Danone shares were up 28 francs at 720, or 4.05 percent, at 0940 GMT, while the CAC index was up 0.39 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452 wem/pnt</p>
